      "writtenOn": "2020-09-17T01:12:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "None of our real devices even set TARGET_ARCH_VARIANT :\u003d armv8-2a, so I don\u0027t have high hopes that the whole ecosystem will know to set TARGET_ARCH_VARIANT :\u003d armv8-2a+dotprod.  Is there any way to enable these instructions that we could add to the appropriate cpu variants cflags instead?  I wonder if we should get rid of arch variant and make everything a cpu variant, and then the cpu variants would set the appropriate -march.",
      "revId": "70b96b0d645d2c76ed58b6d5bdcc15dc21b13b5a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
